  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="4.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IAtr">I Atr</ref> 4.1</head>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="ang" source="#liebermann" n="4.1" corresp="#wit-h">Gif he ðonne borh næbbe, slea mon hine ⁊ on ful lecge.</ab>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="ang" source="#liebermann" n="4.1" corresp="#wit-b">Gyf he ðonne borh næbbe, slea man hine ⁊ hine on ful lecge.</ab>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="la" source="#liebermann" n="4.1" corresp="#wit-q">Si tunc plegium non habeat, occidatur et cum dampnatis inhumetur.</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#robertson" n="4.1" corresp="#wit-b">Gyf he ðonne borh næbbe, slea man hine ⁊ hine on ful lecge.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#robertson" corresp="#wit-b">If he has no surety, he shall be slain and buried in unconsecrated ground.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="de" source="#liebermann">Wenn er aber keine Bürgschaft erhält, so tödte man ihn, und lege ihn in schimpfliches [Grab].</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude" ana="#fromGerman">But if he gets no surety, let him be killed and laid in a dishonoured [grave].</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
